  - "machine-learning"
  - "metrics"
  - "auroc"
  - "aoscr"
  - "delong"
  - "calibration"
abstract: >-
  A small, framework-agnostic Python library that bundles the metrics
  required for credible Open-Set Recognition (OSR) and OOD-detection
  publications. Includes AUROC, FPR@95TPR, AUPR-In/Out, canonical AOSCR
  (Dhamija et al. 2018), four-class OSR partitioning, calibration metrics
  (ECE, Brier), and statistical comparison tools (DeLong test, bootstrap
  confidence intervals with optional class-stratification). All functions
  take plain numpy arrays with consistent score-direction conventions
  (higher = more OOD).
